                                                "example_id": "7afa8153-8406-4f77-b936-5f0fefe51c4d",
                                                "sense_id": "d1e6ca55-6609-3343-af34-0b3d8fdac115",
                                                "text": "Anyone who has lost their way in cyberspace—realizing they have just phased into what they had previously categorized as 'solid' matter—will understand this example."
